      {
        "id": "blk_80046",
        "order": 38,
        "nodeType": "p",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "level": 0,
        "styleId": "3",
        "text": "本模板基于https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1se411U7Dy/创建，添加了东南大学硕博论文封面。模板支持以下自动化格式更新：",
